  "rationale": "The plant automaton G1 models the robot's perception-action cycle, separating sensor outcomes (uncontrollable) from motion commands (controllable). The specification automata E1-E4 bind each perception outcome to a unique, safe, and efficient action, enforcing recovery after obstacles and ensuring only one controllable is enabled per state. This structure guarantees safe, systematic exploration with short, deterministic recovery turns.",
